  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.103 - AM021 fixes simple element conversions on ReverseMap\n- Reverse-direction simple element mismatches now offer the executable Select conversion action\n- The fixer resolves the originating semantic CreateMap and swaps its source/destination types\n- The generated ForMember remains attached to the diagnosed ReverseMap chain\n- No rule ID or severity changes",
